  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest for People People for Forest - Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RFN with its partners will monitor and give input to selected national policies, mainly the forest moratorium, NDC implementation and the Indonesian Environment Fund. They will also collaborate with national and subnational authorities to support enabling policies for rights-based rainforest management. RFN will also develop a pilot project targeting banks and investors in order to incentivizebusinesses to halt deforestation. Improved national policies to strengthen protection of rainforests and biodiversity management</narrative>
  </description>
